  m_Name: zebra_car_no_yield
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: RoadReady.Runtime::RoadReady.Config.HazardDefinition
  hazardId: zebra_car_no_yield
  displayName: Car does not stop at the zebra
  type: 2
  description: 
  severity: 3
  perspective: 1
  requiredResponse: 3
  responseWindowSeconds: 7
  safeReactionSeconds: 1.5
  borderlineReactionSeconds: 2.5
  gazeConeDegrees: 18
  feedbackSafe: You checked, saw the car was not slowing and waited. Exactly right.
  feedbackBorderline: You waited, but did not clearly look at the car first. Check
    every lane before deciding.
  feedbackUnsafe: You stepped out in front of a car that was not stopping. A zebra
    gives you priority only once drivers have actually stopped.
  otherPerspectiveInsight: From the driver's seat, a pedestrian standing back from
    the kerb is easy to miss at speed. Step to the edge, make eye contact and wait
    until the car has clearly stopped.
